      "releaseNotes": "Faster, smoother, and more powerful: Experience the latest version of the Upside app today! Download now to start earning cash back on your daily purchases.",
      "version": "26.22.0",
      "wrapperType": "software",
      "currency": "USD",
      "description": "Make every day a little more rewarding with Upside, the ultimate cash back rewards app for gas, groceries, and dining.\n\nYour regular grocery run. Your usual fill-up. Your go-to dinner spot. Upside fits right into your life, giving you real cash back on the things you already buy, without changing a thing about how you shop.\n\nHow Upside works\n- Find offers near you\n- Claim an offer before you pay\n- Pay as usual with your credit or debit card\n- Earn cash back in your account\n\nCash out whenever you want.\n\nEarn cash back on the things you already buy\nUpside works across the everyday purchases you're already making:\n\nGas: Stop overpaying at the pump, check live gas prices at participating locations, and find the best deals at the gas stations. With offers at 30,000+ station gas locations nationwide, including major brands like Circle K, Caseys, Murphys, Shell, Gulf, Sunoco, Marathon, there's almost always an offer close by. Earn up to 25¢/gal on your first fill-up. We partner with local businesses and big brands so you can earn cash back on top of your existing fuel rewards and loyalty programs.\n\nGroceries: Earn cash back on your weekly grocery run at participating stores. Get an average 13% cash back in select markets, and make the most of what's already on your list.\n\nDining: Earn cash back when you dine out or grab takeout at local restaurants and national favorites like Taco Bell, Pizza Hut, Jersey Mikes and Dominos. \n\nDownload the app to see offers near you.\n\nSimple, flexible ways to earn\n\n- No coupons to clip, no codes to remember\n- Check in or upload a receipt, depending on the offer\n- Stack Upside cash back on top of your credit card rewards, fuel rewards, and loyalty programs\n- Works across gas, groceries, and dining, all in one app\n\nUpside fits into how you already pay and earn. A fill-up becomes a small win. A grocery run adds up. Dinner out feels a little smarter. That's the idea.\n\nCash back that's actually yours\n\n- No points, no converting, what you see is what you get\n- No redemption minimum, cash out whenever you want\n- Cash out to your bank account or gift cards\n- Track every dollar right in the app\n\nWhy people keep coming back to Upside\n\nBecause it works without asking you to do more. You don't need to hunt for deals, clip coupons, or rethink how you spend. Upside quietly turns the purchases you were already going to make into something that earns you back a little more, fill-up after fill-up, grocery run after grocery run, dinner after dinner. Small choices that add up to something that actually feels worth it.\n\nAnd because there are no points to decode, no minimums to hit, and no hoops to jump through, what you earn is simply yours.\n\nA win for you — and the places you go\n\nWe partner with local businesses and big brands to bring you relevant offers nearby. You earn cash back. Businesses grow. And Upside only earns when both sides win.\n\nTrusted by millions\n\nJoin 5 million+ people who've already earned over $1 billion in cash back on gas, groceries, and restaurants. With a 4.5-star rating on Google Play, Upside is the kind of app that quietly becomes part of your routine — because it fits around your life, not the other way around. Frequent users earn an average of $255 in their first year, and there's probably an offer near you right now.\n\nDownload Upside and start earning cash back today.",
